/// ## Input document immutability
///
/// Mapping operates by creating an entirely new object during assignments, this has the
/// advantage of treating the original referenced document as immutable and therefore
/// queryable at any stage of your mapping. For example, with the following mapping:
///
/// ```coffeescript
