/// might be more efficient to use the [`mutation`
/// processor](https://docs.redpanda.com/redpanda-connect/components/processors/mutation)
/// instead.
///
/// ## Error handling
///
/// Bloblang mappings can fail, in which case the message remains unchanged, errors are
/// logged, and the message is flagged as having failed, allowing you to use [standard
/// processor error handling
/// patterns](https://docs.redpanda.com/redpanda-connect/configuration/error_handling).
///
/// However, Bloblang itself also provides powerful ways of ensuring your mappings do not
